    "turn_idx": 13,
    "turn_text": "Yes, sir. And so you heard that report that they're just running now today. The markets had a little turmoil. I guess banks are worried about potential for a rough financial year in 2023. What do you see from because you're there sifting through the numbers all the time too. What do you see from your vantage point?",
